
53:As they wait for the bus home, Shiroko takes out the prize she won.
54:Shiroko
55:Here, this is for you. Sensei said you like whales.
56:Hoshino
57:That's why you entered the competition? Wow! Thank you, Shiroko! This is so...mature of you!
58:I'm glad you like it.
59:Shiroko... Did you have fun today?
60:Yes. We got to experience so many new things.
61:In that case, let's organize our own school festival sometime.
62:Yes, that would be...exciting!
63:...
64:"Shiroko, Shiroko..."
65:"We're nearly back. Time to get up, Shiroko."
66:"The next stop is Allied Hyakkiyako Academy."
67:Shiroko emerged from her daze to find herself standing at the gates to Allied Hyakkiyako Academy.
68:You don't usually doze off in broad daylight, Shiroko. Is it because the weather is so good today?
69:...Maybe.
70:You slept so well. Did you have a good dream?
71:...Yes, I had a very happy dream about a school festival.
72:Well, your dream is about to come true then. Nonomi, Ayane, and Serika are already inside waiting for us to start today's festival. Let's hurry up and join them.
73:The two hold hands and walk side-by-side into the lively atmosphere of Allied Hyakkiyako Academy...
